  "sources": [
    {
      "kind": "docs",
      "ref": "https://doc.dynamicweb.dev/manual/dynamicweb10/settings/system/repositories/facets.html"
    },
    {
      "kind": "docs",
      "ref": "https://doc.dynamicweb.dev/documentation/implementing/repositories/indexes/index.html"
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "ref": "A 10.30.6 host with a headless product repository, read-only, 2026-11-13: get_index_facets 7 facet groups; get_index_facet_fields Headless/Products 266 fields with keys systemName, name, group, typeName; Headless/Products.facets reads ParentGroupIDs, which Headless/Products.index does not declare."
    },
    {
      "kind": "release",
      "ref": "arguments.generated: the Analyzed flag of every field with a fixed system name that ContentIndexSchemaExtender, FileIndexSchemaExtender (Dynamicweb 10.30.6) and ProductIndexSchemaExtender (Dynamicweb.Ecommerce 10.30.6) generate, read from the FieldDefinition initialisers of the shipped assemblies (manifest components). default-fields is AnalyzeField(): analysed unless /Globalsettings/Ecom/Indexing/DoNotAnalyzeDefaultFields is true. default-fields-if-text is AnalyzeField(value type is text) for product custom fields and category fields, whose value type is not in Files. Page is the Page table's columns, generated not analysed except PageMenuText, PageKeywords, PageDescription and PageMetaTitle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "ref": "A 10.30.6 host with a headless product repository and the Swift 2 release repositories, read-only, 2026-11-14: 7 .facets files, 25 facets under System/Repositories; every facet resolves through its .query to an .index; Headless/Products.facets Manufacturer_Facet (Field, Analyzed false), PriceRange (Grouping, Analyzed false) and ParentGroupIDs (generated, not analysed)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "ref": "Revision 4, scope (maintainer ruling, 2026-11-14): a build is judged on the repositories it ships; repositories left on the host by something else are reported, not judged. On a 10.30.6 host carrying a headless edition and the Swift 2 release Files, read-only, 2026-11-14: all 10 offenders of 25 facets were in repository folders no layer of the edition ships (Files/Files.facets, and ProductsFrontend/Products.facets and Electricals.facets reading category fields that host does not have); the edition's own Headless/Products.facets had none."
    }
  ]
}
